nct Name.', 'description': 'Three Records with distinct Names are added to section 4. For each record the hash does not contain the name, so a new RRset is created each time.'}]}, {'group': 'Hash Contains Name but No Matching RRset (newset true after inner loop)', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'section', 'value': 5}], 'expected': 'A list containing two RRsets. The first RRset holds a Record of type A. The second RRset holds a Record of the same Name but a different Type B.', 'description': 'First add a Record (Name X, Type A). Then add a second Record (Name X, Type B). When processing the second record, `hash.contains(name)` is true, the inner loop iterates existing RRsets but does not find a matching type, so `newset` remains true and a new RRset is created.'}]}]
